      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im looking to do a massive kidney detox since i've been dealing with calcium oxalate stones lately. i've been reading that mega-dosing vitamin c is amazing for flushing out toxins and boosting kidney function. i'm planning on doing 3000mg a day to really get it done... what's the best way to dose this to make sure i'm getting the most benefit for my kidneys?",
